    'landing.features': 'Features', 'landing.howItWorks': 'How it Works', 'landing.pricing': 'Pricing', 'landing.faq': 'FAQ', 'landing.contact': 'Contact', 'landing.signIn': 'Sign in', 'landing.getStarted': 'Get started free →', 'landing.getStartedShort': 'Get started', 'landing.closeMenu': 'Close navigation menu', 'landing.openMenu': 'Open navigation menu', 'landing.scroll': 'Scroll', 'landing.heroLead': 'Let AI get you', 'landing.openFeature': 'Open {feature}', 'landing.stepLabel': 'STEP', 'landing.feature.autoApply': 'AI Auto-Apply', 'landing.feature.autoApplyDesc': 'Scans 50,000+ European jobs daily, matches your profile, auto-fills forms and applies — up to 100 jobs per day.', 'landing.feature.resume': 'Dynamic Resume Tailoring', 'landing.feature.resumeDesc': 'Automatically adjusts keywords and skill weights for each JD. 3× better ATS pass rate with live Tiptap editor preview.', 'landing.feature.coverLetter': 'AI Cover Letter', 'landing.feature.coverLetterDesc': 'Generates a professional, personalised cover letter in 30 seconds — choose Professional, Enthusiastic or Concise tone.', 'landing.feature.gmail': 'Smart Gmail Inbox', 'landing.feature.gmailDesc': 'Auto-syncs recruitment emails, detects interview invitations and rejections, sends follow-up reminders.', 'landing.feature.tracker': 'Full Application Tracker', 'landing.feature.trackerDesc': 'Kanban board for every application — from Saved → Applied → Interview → Offer. Never miss a follow-up.', 'landing.feature.extension': 'Chrome Extension', 'landing.feature.extensionDesc': 'Browse LinkedIn / Indeed / Glassdoor and save jobs with one click. Sidebar shows your match score and auto-fills forms.', 'landing.step.upload': 'Upload Resume · Set Preferences', 'landing.step.uploadDesc': 'Upload your existing resume or generate one with AI. Set target roles, locations and salary range — Persona extracts your full profile automatically.', 'landing.step.search': 'AI Agent Searches Automatically', 'landing.step.searchDesc': 'The Agent scans every major European job board daily, filters by your match-score threshold, and applies or sends you candidates for review.', 'landing.step.track': 'Track Progress · Prepare for Interviews', 'landing.step.trackDesc': 'All application statuses sync in real time. Gmail auto-categorises recruiter emails and AI generates interview prep notes per role.', 'landing.testimonial.zhang': 'Got interviews at Adyen and Booking.com within two weeks using ApplyMate. It used to take me a whole week to send 10 applications manually — now I auto-apply to 50+ a day.', 'landing.testimonial.maria': 'The AI cover letter generator is incredible. Each letter feels personalized, and my response rate went from 5% to 23%. Got my dream job at Zalando in 6 weeks.', 'landing.testimonial.ahmed': 'Chrome extension made everything so smooth. Just browsing LinkedIn, click "Save", and the AI fills the application automatically. Absolutely game-changing.', 'landing.faq.freePlan': 'What are the limits on the Free plan?', 'landing.faq.freePlanAnswer': 'The Free plan includes the features and limits shown on the pricing card above. Limits and included features are kept current by the ApplyMate team.', 'landing.faq.autoApply': 'How effective is AI auto-apply?', 'landing.faq.autoApplyAnswer': 'Users who use ApplyMate AI to tailor their resumes see an average 3× improvement in ATS pass rate and 2.4× more interview invitations. Results depend on your skill match and competition for the role.', 'landing.faq.boards': 'Which job boards are supported?', 'landing.faq.boardsAnswer': 'We support LinkedIn, Indeed, Glassdoor, StepStone, XING, Arbeitsagentur, Adzuna, Reed, IrishJobs and more — 14 sources in total. We are continuously expanding the list.', 'landing.faq.safety': 'Is my resume data safe?', 'landing.faq.safetyAnswer': 'Your data is stored on EU servers (Neon PostgreSQL, eu-west-2) and is fully GDPR-compliant. We never sell your resume data or use it to train AI models.', 'landing.faq.paidPlans': 'How do paid plan changes work?', 'landing.faq.paidPlansAnswer': 'Paid plan upgrades, trial requests and cancellations are handled by the ApplyMate team while self-serve checkout is being rolled out. Contact us and we will confirm the options and effective date.', 'landing.faq.coverLetter': 'How good is the AI-generated cover letter?', 'landing.faq.coverLetterAnswer': 'The AI generates personalised letters based on the specific JD and your actual experience — not generic templates. You can review and edit before sending. Supports Professional, Enthusiastic and Concise tone styles.', 'landing.faq.languages': 'Does ApplyMate support non-English applications?', 'landing.faq.languagesAnswer': 'Yes. The platform supports English, German, French and more. The AI automatically selects the appropriate language based on the target company and job posting language.', 'landing.stat.jobs': 'European jobs/day', 'landing.stat.ats': 'ATS pass rate boost', 'landing.stat.trial': 'Pro free trial', 'landing.stat.satisfaction': 'User satisfaction',
    'landing.hiredEurope': 'hired in Europe', 'landing.heroDescription': 'ApplyMate AI scans jobs, tailors your resume, writes cover letters and applies — automatically.', 'landing.heroDescription2': 'You just show up to interviews.', 'landing.startFree': 'Start for free', 'landing.seeFeatures': 'See features ↓', 'landing.everyStep': 'Every step of your job search,', 'landing.handledByAi': 'handled by AI', 'landing.featuresDescription': 'From finding a job to receiving an offer — AI assists at every stage so you can apply 10× faster.', 'landing.automatedHunting': 'automated job hunting', 'landing.successStories': 'Success Stories', 'landing.landedJob': 'They already', 'landing.simplePricing': 'Simple, transparent', 'landing.pricingWord': 'pricing', 'landing.trialDetails': 'Trial details are shown on each plan. No credit card required.', 'landing.freeTrial': 'day free trial', 'landing.frequentlyAsked': 'Frequently asked', 'landing.questions': 'questions', 'landing.email': 'Email', 'landing.nextOffer': 'Your next offer', 'landing.startsHere': 'starts here', 'landing.joinSeekers': 'Join the job seekers who already landed their role with ApplyMate AI.', 'landing.startFreePlan': 'Start with the free plan and contact us when you are ready to upgrade.', 'landing.aiFooter': 'AI-powered European job search automation. 50,000+ jobs/day.',
